Aerie-Purpose: Register chrome://aerie-guard.top-chrome, the pop-out panel of the Aerie Guard icon, with the WebUI config map, and name its host and its metrics name.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_web_ui_configs.cc, chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn, chrome/common/webui_url_constants.h, tools/metrics/histograms/metadata/page/histograms.xml, tools/metrics/histograms/metadata/ui/histograms.xml
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #100. The page is a top-chrome WebUI (AerieGuardUIConfig, in the overlay under
chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_guard). The host and URL constants sit next to the ones of Tab Search.
WebUIContentsWrapperT static_asserts that ".AerieGuard" is a WebUIName variant in page/histograms.xml,
so the variant is added there and (LINT.IfChange) in ui/histograms.xml. The config is not preloadable.

